PASS clean: actual-source lifetime
PASS clean@split: actual-source lifetime
PASS private-sharing: private guard refuses sharing
PASS already-shared: shared image refuses private guard
PASS guard-no-pin: guard pins lifetime without adding owner
PASS guard-leak: final guard releases pin and exclusion
PASS pin-as-owner: pin is not an owner
PASS no-owner-get: owner increments both counts
PASS skip-drain: last owner drains before last pin
PASS drain-every-owner: nonfinal owner preserves mappings
PASS pin-leak: final pin frees once without another drain
PASS drop-before-drain: extinction: AddrSpace final lifetime drop before mapping drain
PASS early-destroy: extinction: AddrSpace final lifetime drop with live owners
PASS release-drops-lifetime: last owner drains before last pin
PASS release-early-last: extinction: addrspace_destroy of an AddrSpace still owned
PASS no-quiesce: last owner stops each mapped device once, before the drain
PASS quiesce-after-drain: last owner stops each mapped device once, before the drain
PASS release-drops-lifetime@split: between release and destroy the last owner's lifetime is held
PASS teardown-in-release: release tears nothing down before destroy
PASS early-destroy@split: extinction: AddrSpace final lifetime drop before mapping drain
